* Model chain ordered best-first (gemini-3.8-flash). Budget stopped being the
  constraint at 10,000 requests per day, so quality decides the order.
* The problem detail page asks the AI by itself - no button. Word overlap
  renders first so the page is never blank, then the AI answer replaces it.
* Fixed: a timeout on the first model abandoned the whole chain, so models 2
  and 3 were never tried.
* Added AI_DEADLINE (45s) across the whole re-rank.
* Dormant second provider, active only if GROQ_API_KEY is set.
* check_gemini.py prints the exact status per model.

Verified: 32/32 smoke checks, 21/21 provider-chain checks, frontend builds.

